{
  "id": "ISA.21",
  "number": "21",
  "bookId": "ISA",
  "reference": "Isaiah 21",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent",
  "verseCount": 17,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "21",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "21",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The burden of the desert of the sea. As whirlwinds in the south pass through;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "so",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.21.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.21.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "it cometh from the desert, from a terrible land.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A grievous vision is declared unto me; the treacherous dealer dealeth treacherously, and the spoiler spoileth. Go up, O Elam: besiege, O Media; all the sighing thereof have I made to cease.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore are my loins filled with pain: pangs have taken hold upon me, as the pangs of a woman that travaileth: I was bowed down at the hearing",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "of it;",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.21.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.21.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I was dismayed at the seeing",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "of it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.21.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.21.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "My heart panted, fearfulness affrighted me: the night of my pleasure hath he turned into fear unto me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Prepare the table, watch in the watchtower, eat, drink: arise, ye princes,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.21.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.21.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anoint the shield.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For thus hath the Lord said unto me, Go, set a watchman, let him declare what he seeth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he saw a chariot",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "with",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.21.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.21.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a couple of horsemen, a chariot of asses,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.21.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.21.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a chariot of camels; and he hearkened diligently with much heed:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he cried, A lion: My lord, I stand continually upon the watchtower in the daytime, and I am set in my ward whole nights:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And, behold, here cometh a chariot of men,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "with",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.21.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.21.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a couple of horsemen. And he answered and said, Babylon is fallen, is fallen; and all the graven images of her gods he hath broken unto the ground.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O my threshing, and the corn of my floor: that which I have heard of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.21.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.21.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of hosts, the God of Israel, have I declared unto you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ The burden of Dumah. He calleth to me out of Seir, Watchman, what of the night? Watchman, what of the night?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The watchman said, The morning cometh, and also the night: if ye will enquire, enquire ye: return, come.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ The burden upon Arabia. In the forest in Arabia shall ye lodge, O ye travelling companies of Dedanim.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The inhabitants of the land of Tema brought water to him that was thirsty, they prevented with their bread him that fled.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For they fled from the swords, from the drawn sword, and from the bent bow, and from the grievousness of war.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For thus hath the Lord said unto me, Within a year, according to the years of an hireling, and all the glory of Kedar shall fail:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the residue of the number of archers, the mighty men of the children of Kedar, shall be diminished: for the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.21.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.21.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God of Israel hath spoken",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.21.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.21.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "ISA.22",
    "number": "22",
    "bookId": "ISA"
  },
